sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Platform Admin
    participant KubeAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant Operator as mlflow-operator<br/>controller-manager
    participant Helm as Helm Renderer<br/>(in-process)
    participant Tracking as MLflow Tracking<br/>Deployment
    participant Artifact as Artifact Server<br/>Deployment
    participant MigJob as DB Migration<br/>Job
    participant Gateway as data-science-gateway<br/>(Gateway API)
    participant Prometheus as Prometheus<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS

    rect rgb(230, 245, 255)
        Note over User,KubeAPI: Flow 1: MLflow Deployment Reconciliation
        User->>KubeAPI: kubectl apply MLflow CR
        KubeAPI->>Operator: Watch event (MLflow CR created/updated)
        Operator->>Helm: Render chart with computed values
        Helm-->>Operator: Rendered Kubernetes manifests
        Operator->>KubeAPI: Apply Deployments, Services,<br/>SA, PVCs, CronJobs
        KubeAPI-->>Operator: Resources created
        Operator->>KubeAPI: Create HTTPRoute (/mlflow)
        Operator->>KubeAPI: Create HTTPRoute (/mlflow-artifacts)
        Operator->>KubeAPI: Create ConsoleLink
        Operator->>KubeAPI: Create ServiceMonitor
        Operator->>KubeAPI: Update MLflow CR status
    end

    rect rgb(255, 245, 230)
        Note over Operator,MigJob: Flow 2: Database Migration Orchestration
        KubeAPI->>Operator: Watch event (MLflow version changed)
        Operator->>KubeAPI: Scale Tracking Deployment to 0
        KubeAPI-->>Operator: Replicas drained
        Operator->>KubeAPI: Create migration Job
        MigJob-->>KubeAPI: Migration complete
        KubeAPI->>Operator: Job completion event
        Operator->>KubeAPI: Restore Tracking Deployment replicas
        KubeAPI-->>Operator: Rollout complete
    end

    rect rgb(230, 255, 230)
        Note over Prometheus,Operator: Flow 3: Metrics Scraping
        Prometheus->>Operator: GET /metrics<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS TLS (service-ca)<br/>Auth: TokenReview + SubjectAccessReview
        Operator-->>Prometheus: Prometheus metrics response
    end

    rect rgb(245, 230, 255)
        Note over Operator,Gateway: Flow 4: Traffic Routing (managed resources)
        Note right of Gateway: External client traffic flows<br/>through Gateway API HTTPRoutes<br/>to managed MLflow instances
        Gateway->>Tracking: /mlflow → Tracking Server
        Gateway->>Artifact: /mlflow-artifacts → Artifact Server
    end
